      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/neha\">@neha</a></p>\n<p>Use Frappe’s override_doctype_dashboards hook.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Create file: custom_app/item_dashboard_override.py</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">def get_dashboard_data(data=None):\n        if data is None:\n                data = {}\n        data[\"heatmap\"] = False  # Hide activity section\n        return data\n</code></pre>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>Add to hooks.py:</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">  override_doctype_dashboards = {\n        \"Item\": \"custom_app.item_dashboard_override.get_dashboard_data\"\n  }\n</code></pre>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>Apply:</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">bench migrate\nbench clear-cache\nbench restart\n</code></pre>",
